    <string name="adult_words_help_entries">One of these words in a channel, movie or series name hides it. Words also used in normal titles (sex, porn, fuck, milf…) are built in and only hide when two different ones appear together. Applies to every playlist.</string>
    <string name="adult_words_rules">Whole words, any case. Spaces match any spacing (“playboy tv” also finds “PlayboyTV”). A * at the end matches any ending (“porn*” finds “porno”). OK or tap on a word to remove it.</string>
